 h Fusion\, in the Student Recreation Center main office\, or over the pho
 ne (973-655-3340).\nCost for Students $10\;  $20 Faculty/Staff\n\nWhere a
 nd when?\n\nJuly 20th\, 2026\n9:00 am – 6:00 pm   \nBegins at Student Rec
 reation Center\n\nWhat to bring: Water\, lunch\, bug spray\, sunscreen\, 
 towel and bathing suit \nPotential Hazards: Unpredictable weather changes
 \, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/poisonous p
 lants\, and insect bites.\n \n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditiona
 l Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/ev
 ent/12482902
